OL,4,CThirty-one killed in massive fire as   
OL,5,Cfuel tanker crashes on Cairo highway   
OL,6,GThirty-one people have been killed and 
OL,7,G21 others injured in a large fire on a 
OL,8,Gbusy highway in Cairo after a fuel     
OL,9,Gtanker crashed, Egypt's health         
OL,10,Gministry says.                         
OL,12,FHospitals nearby treated patients      
OL,13,Fsuffering burns and smoke inhalation   
OL,14,Fafter the incident, which occurred on  
OL,15,Fa section of a ring road in the Warraq 
OL,16,Fneighbourhood, to the north of the old 
OL,17,Fcity centre, on Wednesday evening.     
